      "content": "idk i dont think i have migraines usually... it just happened so fast and it felt different. like it was just a sudden explosion in my head. u sure it's just a migraine? it feels way too intense for that. i dont really want to sit in an er for 8 hours if i dont have to, can i just take some extra tylenol or something and wait to see if it goes away?",
