      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i dont have a fever or anything right now. i just feel really lightheaded and my neck feels super stiff and tight... maybe i just pulled a muscle or something from sleeping weird? i really dont want to spend my whole night in the hospital over a headache. honestly i feel like i can just sleep it off if i take a couple extra pills. is it really that big of a deal if i just wait until morning to see how i feel?",
